<title>ALBANIA: SOCCER-TIRANA PARTIZANI WIN ALBANIA CUP FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-TIRANA PARTIZANI WIN ALBANIA CUP FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>TIRANA 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Partizani of Tirana beat Flamurtari of Vlore 4-3 in a penalty shoot-out after drawing 2-2 (halftime 1-1) in the Albania cup final on Saturday.</p>
<p>Attendance 4,000.</p>
</text>
